  "text": "Addlink adds S90 series PCI-Express4.0 (x4) NVMe SSD | CdrInfo.com Breaking News ASUS Announces XG Core Radeon RX 9060 XT LP 16GB GDDR6 Razer Unveils the Hammerhead V3 Chroma Sony Introduces USB-C Wired Headphones MDR-3R Greenliant heads to electronica 2026 with its full industrial SSD lineup CORSAIR Brings Comfort in Full Bloom with Dark Cherry Blossom TC500 and TC100 RELAXED Gaming Chairs Search form The addlink \"S90\" series is an NVMe M.2 SSD that supports PCI-Express4.0 (x4) connection. The form factor is M.2 2280, and the lineup includes two models with capacities of 1TB and 2TB. NAND Flash is a 3D TLC NAND with advanced wear leveling and powerful garbage collection capabilities. The maximum transfer speed is 5,000MB / sec for sequential reading, 4,400MB / sec for writing, 750,000 IOPS for random reading, and 700,000 IOPS for writing. The cache memory is DDR4, the main body size is 22 mm in width, 80 mm in depth, 3.5 mm in height, and weighs about 8.2 g. MTBF is 1.8 million hours and the product warranty is 5 years. There is no informatio about the retail prices of the products. Model number S90 1TB (ad1TBS90M2P) S90 2TB (ad2TBS90M2P) MPN 4712927862543 4712927862550 capacity 1TB 2TB Form factor M.2 2280 interface PCI Express Gen 4.0 x4 (NVM Express 1.3) Flash standard 3D TLC NAND DRAM cache DDR4 Sequential Read Speed Maximum: 5000MB / s Sequential Write Speed Maximum: 4400MB / s Random Read Speed (IOPS 4KB) Maximum: 750K IOPS Random Write Speed (IOPS 4KB) Maximum: 700K IOPS Operating environment temperature 0 ° C to 70 ° C (during operation) MTBF 1.8 million hours Warranty 5 years body size 80mm x 22mm x 3.5mm Body weight About 8.2g Related Posts addlink Launches P50 USB SSD addlink Launches Turbo Play MicroSD Express addlink Virtual Showcase 2025: Explore what’s our next in storage Addlink P30 1TB Portable SSD addlink announces P30 40Gbps Magnetic Portable SSD addlink Unveils the S85 PCIe 4.0 SSD addlink Launches P21 USB SSD addlink Unveils NAS D60 and D20 SSD Latest News GPUs ASUS Announces XG Core Radeon RX 9060 XT LP 16GB GDDR6 Consumer Electronics Razer Unveils the Hammerhead V3 Chroma Consumer Electronics Sony Introduces USB-C Wired Headphones MDR-3R Enterprise & IT Greenliant heads to electronica 2026 with its full industrial SSD lineup Cameras CORSAIR Brings Comfort in Full Bloom with Dark Cherry Blossom TC500 and TC100 RELAXED Gaming Chairs Popular Reviews Endorfy Thock V2 Wireless Keyboard SoundPeats Cove Pro The Quiet Technology Behind the Spin Akaso Brave 8 Lite SoundPeats C30 Kioxia Exceria Plus G3 512GB microSD be quiet! Dark Perk Mice XbotGo Chamaleon Main menu Home News Reviews Essays About Submit News Contact Us Privacy Promotion Advertise RSS Feed About Privacy Contact Us Promotional Opportunities @ CdrInfo.com Advertise on out site Submit your News to our site RSS Feed",
